 "fill_reason": {
  "pin_bound": "SRAM macro-face pin bound (safe-design item 6): each hnx_sram_1r1w_128x256_r43 carries 393 live pins (rd_out 256 + wd_in 137 + ctl) on its 43.2 um W face and 119 live wd_in on its E face (9.1 / um); abutted 3-stacks (the _nf / variant B rows) give the column channels > 6 live pins / um and drove the _nf GRT into the stall; the 86.4 um row pitch keeps <= 4.6 / um of channel height with a full-width band <= 21.6 um from every pin. Leaf faces: N leaf N 1,065 pins / 432 um, seam 859 / 432 um (<= 2.8 / um per bus range)"
